ning to the published API surface of the Llama Stack\n53\t  distribution (the OpenAI-compatible REST APIs and CRD-facing behavior as\n54\t  applicable).\n55\t- Author the deprecation policy for the published surface and bring any\n56\t  deprecated surface into conformance with it.\n57\t- Implement and test the upgrade path from each of the last two Tech Preview\n58\t  releases.\n59\t- Remediate the API-stability and upgrade-path gaps identified by the\n60\t  GA-readiness assessment that fall within this epic's scope.\n61\t\n62\t## Acceptance Criteria\n63\t\n64\t- Every published API carries versioning consistent with the documented\n65\t  versioning approach.\n66\t- The deprecation policy is documented, and any deprecated surface follows it.\n67\t- The upgrade path from each of the last two Tech Preview releases is tested\n68\t  with passing, recorded results.\n69\t- Every assessment-identified API stability or upgrade-path gap assigned to\n70\t  this scope is remediated or explicitly dispositioned with rationale.\n71\t\n72\t## HLR Traceability\n73\t\n74\t- HLR-2 (P0): full coverage — versioned APIs, deprecation policy, and tested\n75\t  upgrade path from the last two TP releases.\n76\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-abcd2d40aef5983b","agent_id":"a0816477c18f77a1e","session_id":"85972203-1fc3-4cec-8474-9537ba830cbb","uuid":"90fa0718-b5dc-4032-8ef7-bce5974e7831","timestamp":"2026-10-26T11:23:46.255Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9004f38ce173e498","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
