t gated behind the experimental flag.\n54\t- The integration is validated against the published stable API surface.\n55\t- Usage documentation for the supported integration is delivered.\n56\t- Clusters using the experimental flag can migrate to the supported\n57\t  integration without loss of function.\n58\t\n59\t## HLR Traceability\n60\t\n61\t- HLR-4 (P1): Llama Stack side — the integration becomes supported and\n62\t  documented in GA distributions.\n63\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8c6d160a01e76188","agent_id":"a5f8ac71d1d2d3442","session_id":"85972203-1fc3-4cec-8474-9537ba830cbb","uuid":"53bb1ea9-9a1d-4e0e-95b4-7ea5de581644","timestamp":"2026-10-26T11:27:58.483Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8658d0b003f61499","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
